        "original_id": "f19452cf-eadb-51e1-8762-ddacb1c23ee0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Private Music\n- People: Ringo Starr, Etta James, Taj Mahal, A. J. Croce, Richard Starkey\n- Products: Love's Been Rough on Me\n- Topics: new-age music, mainstream music, the Beatles\n\nFacts:\n- Richard Starkey, known professionally as Ringo Starr, was born on 7 July 1940.\n- Ringo Starr gained worldwide fame as the drummer for the Beatles.\n- Private Music specialized in new-age music before shifting sharply toward mainstream music.\n- Private Music signed Taj Mahal, Ringo Starr, Etta James, and A. J. Croce during its move toward the mainstream.\n- Love's Been Rough on Me is the twenty-second studio album by Etta James.\n- Love's Been Rough on Me was released in 1997 through Private Music.",
